      "kind": "text",
      "name": "The NullDull client is one MCP server and CLI for every…",
      "text": "The NullDull client is one MCP server and CLI for every product, distributed as signed releases. Agents act for the member who connected them, and each product needs its own capability on the connection. Since client 0.18.0 (19 November 2026), each workspace keeps its own login, so projects bound to different workspaces stay signed in at the same time.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
