      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Connections never exceed the member’s own access, and…",
      "text": "Connections never exceed the member’s own access, and Secrets, Grid, Locale and Tasks capabilities are off until the connection owner turns them on. API keys only read; writing stays with the app, agent connections and the HTTP API, where reviews, version checks and receipts apply.",
